#: ../../../developer/building/qubes-builder.rst:14
#: c1a149291df240849844dbb7f72a5b32
msgid ""
"We have a fully automated build system for Qubes, that downloads, builds and "
"packages all the Qubes components, and finally should spit out a ready-to-"
"use installation ISO, all in a `secure <https://www.qubes-os.org/"
"news/2016/05/30/build-security/>`__ way."
msgstr ""

